WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:04,120
Zhu Shao

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,260
This guy named Lin is too crazy.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,720
I really thought I got an investment from the military

4
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:11,860
Just treat yourself as a master and shut up

5
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,360
He is now the Commander-in-Chief of the New Fire Legion

6
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:21,040
Even the first-class aristocratic families in the provincial capital would not dare to provoke you.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,040
Entering the devil's face

8
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,000
No one is allowed to take the initiative to provoke Lin Yuan

9
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:26,680
If you insist on making your own decisions

10
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:38,120
The Zhu family will clean up the house themselves, Brother Yuan

11
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:39,800
I'm feeling hairy in my heart

12
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:41,580
That's the Zhu family

13
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,460
The way we refused just now

14
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:45,380
Is it a little more hardcore?

15
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:47,850
Regret

16
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:52,690
Regret is not a big deal

17
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:54,650
I have more than 20,000 black magic beads

18
00:00:54,850 --> 00:00:55,850
Just go in and mine.

19
00:00:56,450 --> 00:00:58,250
If we can stick together

20
00:00:58,890 --> 00:00:59,800
Maybe more
